{"words": [{"text": "وَقَالَ", "translation": "And said"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(do) not"}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "know"}, {"text": "لَوْلَا", "translation": "Why not"}, {"text": "يُكَلِّمُنَا", "translation": "speaks to us"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "تَأْتِينَآ", "translation": "comes to us"}, {"text": "ءَايَةٌۭ ۗ", "translation": "a sign"}, {"text": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "Like that"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "said"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "قَبْلِهِم", "translation": "before them"}, {"text": "مِّثْلَ", "translation": "similar"}, {"text": "قَوْلِهِمْ ۘ", "translation": "their saying"}, {"text": "تَشَـٰبَهَتْ", "translation": "Became alike"}, {"text": "قُلُوبُهُمْ ۗ", "translation": "their hearts"}, {"text": "قَدْ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "بَيَّنَّا", "translation": "We have made clear"}, {"text": "ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ", "translation": "the signs"}, {"text": "لِقَوْمٍۢ", "translation": "for people"}, {"text": "يُوقِنُونَ", "translation": "(who) firmly believe"}], "sahih": "Those who do not know say, \"Why does Allāh not speak to us or there come to us a sign?\" Thus spoke those before them like their words. Their hearts resemble each other. We have shown clearly the signs to a people who are certain [in faith]."}